{"answer": "The claim is named `customer_number`. It is defined as the constant `CUSTOMER_NUMBER_CLAIM` in `apps/api/src/oauth/customerIdentity.ts`. ADR-001 says the stand-in OIDC login in `apps/api/src/dummyPortal/` issues access tokens that carry it. Issue #338 says a single api claims mapper reads it, and a shared check refuses tokens where it is missing or blank. I only saw this through ADR-001 and the issue text, not the code itself.", "sources": ["adrs/ADR-001-tms-authentication.md", "issue-338", "issue-356"]}
```

